      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight you're carrying is immense, and it's natural to question the purpose when you see the cycle of suffering repeating itself. You are in the middle of a massive, overwhelming system that is not built to fix systemic despair, but to manage acute, daily emergencies. While you can't stop the ocean, you are still the vital element that prevents immediate disaster for so many people who need you right now.",
      "source": "target",
